  "properties": {
    "title": "Creating 3D Tiles",
    "description": "3D Tiles is an OGC community standard for streaming and rendering massive 3D geospatial data. This talk shows workflows to convert 3D formats like CityGML to 3D Tiles and compares\r\nsoftware tools like py3dtiles, mago 3DTiler and PLATEAU GIS Converter.",
